{"resourceIdentifier":"3861","resourceName":"Pingyuan Landfill Gas Power Generation Phase I Project","description":"Pingyuan Landfill Gas Power Generation Phase I Project (hereafter referred to as the project) captures the landfill gas that would have been released to the atmosphere in the absence of the project and generates electricity with the landfill gas (LFG). The electricity is supplied to the China Southern Power Grid (CSPG) to replace the electricity generated from coal-fired power plants of CSPG. \r\nPingyuan landfill site is located in Dazhe Town, Pingyuan County, Meizhou City, Guangdong Province, P. R. China.\r\nThe purpose of the project is to use LFG, which consists mainly of methane, for electricity generation. It includes LFG collection system, LFG pre-treatment system and electricity generation system. The project started to construct on 19/08/2020 according to the contract of construction. The total installed capacity of the project is 2MW. The project consists of 2 sets of 1000kW generators which were was operated since 08/02/2021. LFG collected is used for electricity generation with internal combustion generators to generate about 61,489MWh supplying to CSPG during the first 7 years crediting period. The project achieves emission reductions in two aspects: 1) it avoids methane emissions by capturing and destroying LFG which would have been directly vented into the atmosphere in the baseline scenario; 2) it reduces CO2 emissions by displacing part of the electricity that would otherwise have been supplied by CSPG. The expected average annual emission reductions are","location":{"latitude":24.559722,"longitude":115.930000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-11-07","endExclusive":"2022-12-08","endInclusive":"2022-12-07"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3861"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shenzhen PhasCon Technologies Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3861"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"47435"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"31/05/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 08/02/2021 - 07/02/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=76610&IDKEY=o0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9k105645190","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-PDD-Pingyuan-v4.1 20221020.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-10-20T08:59:18.493Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=76611&IDKEY=aq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhk105646569","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-v4.1 Pingyuan.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-10-20T09:01:10.58Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=88791&IDKEY=miquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfu122442789","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-PDD-Pingyuan-v4.1_clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-04-22T12:05:36.86Z"},{"ur